<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109898" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψαύχην</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ενος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying the neck high,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					253d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				21.248c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.311
				</span></i>
			; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψηχής.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., <i>stately,
				towering,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1061
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					903
				</span></i>
			 (Sardis, <span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>); of a wine-bottle, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.134
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in moral
			sense, <i>stately, haughty,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				250
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Iren.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.641
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), etc.</div>
